Package: com.m3ga.m3gasignalbars
Name: M3gaSignalBars
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Cosmetic full-strength cellular signal bars for classic iOS 6.
 Enable the tweak to display five native iOS cellular bars. Disable it any
 time to restore the real signal reading. This changes only the displayed
 signal-bar count; it does not create cellular service, calls, SMS, or data.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
